{"availability":"available","full":"msndsn123a/Sovereign-NB","name":"Sovereign-NB","description":"Deterministic, sub-microsecond bare-metal neural compute engine in #![no_std] Rust booting directly from UEFI.","category":"Education","language":"Rust","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T00:39:03Z","updated":"2026-10-02T19:40:47Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["bare-metal","deep-learning","embedded","low-latency","neural-network","no-std","rust","uefi"],"demo":"https://msndsn123a.github.io/Sovereign-NB/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:12.449Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:12.449Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:09:12.449Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T11:31:35.719Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T16:31:30.561Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T20:09:12.449Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sovereign Neural Box is a nostd bare-metal UEFI inference project. Its x86-64 appliance boots a packed ternary model and serves fixed-size input frames over UART; an AArch64 UEFI target exercises the NEON integer kernel and firmware-preserving boot path. Both model math and the in-browser verifier use exact integer operations."],"features":["Dual-architecture inference: 64→32→16 ternary MLP and 16-dimensional causal linear attention with a persistent 16×16 recurrent state.","No-heap inference core: src/main.rs is #![nostd]; the core does not enable Rust alloc or use Vec/heap allocation. Model, DMA, frame, and state storage use fixed-size buffers. UEFI file I/O writes directly into the…","UEFI x86-64 target: built for x8664-unknown-uefi with the repository's nightly toolchain.","AArch64 UEFI target: cross-compiles for aarch64-unknown-uefi and includes an exact-parity NEON MLP path.","User-friendly model updates: the GPT appliance image has a FAT32 EFI System Partition and a FAT32 NEURALDATA volume. Replace NEURALDATA:\\weights.bin to load a different model at the next boot."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/msndsn123a/Sovereign-NB/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"135a6f72f778e6704e6f9b2d634c8e5c5efe534965cd86fb48e14a107fa431b2","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Sovereign Neural Box is a nostd bare-metal UEFI inference project. Its x86-64 appliance boots a packed ternary model and serves fixed-size input frames over UART; an AArch64 UEFI target exercises the NEON integer kernel and firmware-preserving boot path. Both model math and the in-browser verifier use exact integer operations.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/msndsn123a/Sovereign-NB/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"UEFI x86-64 target: built for x8664-unknown-uefi with the repository's nightly toolchain.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/msndsn123a/Sovereign-NB/blob/main/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"135a6f72f778e6704e6f9b2d634c8e5c5efe534965cd86fb48e14a107fa431b2","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/msndsn123a/Sovereign-NB/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T19:40:47Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/msndsn123a/Sovereign-NB/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T10:38:43.329Z","hash":"135a6f72f778e6704e6f9b2d634c8e5c5efe534965cd86fb48e14a107fa431b2","originalBytes":12792,"storedBytes":12792,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["model","attention","tools","uefi","shard","test","neur","signed","wasm","bare-metal","byte","mlp","neural","target","ternary","build","builder","image","inference","input","powershell","rust","before","bytes","fat32","integer","metadata","package","payload","recurrent","uart","x86","appliance","data","ed25519","efi","firmware","frames","identity","